# .mse-set files are binary ZIP archives. Git cannot meaningfully merge them.
# All card-level merging is handled by MergeSetFile.ps1 via SyncNow.ps1.
# On any git-level conflict (e.g. git pull in Launch_Silent.vbs), keep the
# LOCAL version so cards created between syncs are never silently overwritten.
Shared-Set/*.mse-set binary
Shared-Set/*.mse-set merge=ours
